# The lists that Object.keys, Object.getOwnPropertyNames, Reflect.ownKeys, a split by a RegExp, Object.values of a text and Object.entries make are lists themselves: read under a key that is a number or undefined they stay in sight, and the read gives what the row says they hold.
# Each line is the read of one of the six, in the order of the source; with a list that went out the read has no line at all.
# RUN: link accesses mechanisms=all
# CHECK: proven=undefined|string
# CHECK: proven=undefined|string
# CHECK: proven=undefined|string|symbol
# CHECK: proven=undefined|string
# CHECK: proven=undefined|string
# CHECK: proven=undefined|object
